WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:05.840
It’s crazy when you think about all of
the different kinds of foods we eat.

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:09.760
We just swallow and hope
it all works out for the best.

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:11.280
Well, as it turns out,

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:15.680
there are better ways to think about keeping
our bodies humming healthfully along.

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:18.080
Welcome to the
Nutrition Facts Podcast,

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:21.200
I’m your host,
Dr. Michael Greger.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:24.800
There are some
persistent myths about celery

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:26.480
and today we take them on.

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:27.360
In our first story,

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:31.120
NutritionFacts Senior Research
Scientist Kristine Dennis asks:

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:35.120
can celery, a vegetable
relatively high in sodium,

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:37.520
lower blood pressure?

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:40.240
Some plants may help us
reduce high blood pressure

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:42.640
and celery may be one of them.

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:46.960
But celery also contains relatively
high levels of sodium for a vegetable—

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:51.360
about 100 mg of sodium in one cup
(~130 g) of chopped celery.

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:53.520
Even though it's relatively
high in sodium,

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:56.560
it also contains other compounds
like NBP,

00:00:56.560 --> 00:01:00.640
the compound primarily responsible
for celery's taste and aroma,

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:02.320
which can relax
the smooth muscles

00:01:02.320 --> 00:01:04.000
that line blood vessels,

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:07.040
potentially resulting
in lower blood pressure.

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:08.720
And there are other
compounds in celery

00:01:08.720 --> 00:01:11.520
that likely have
antihypertensive effects,

00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:14.080
but those are all based
on rodent studies—

00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:14.880
and indeed,

00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:17.200
celery seed appears
to lower blood pressure

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:19.120
in hypertensive rats.

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:20.480
But what about humans?

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:23.360
You don't know until you put
celery seed to the test,

00:01:23.360 --> 00:01:26.320
or in this case,
celery seed extract,

00:01:26.320 --> 00:01:28.880
in a randomized, triple-blind,
placebo-controlled,

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:31.120
cross-over, clinical trial.

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:34.000
After four weeks of taking
the celery seed extract,

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:36.960
systolic blood pressure dropped
by at least 10 points

00:01:36.960 --> 00:01:39.840
and diastolic blood pressure
by about 8 points.

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:42.400
But the whole celery seed
equivalent would be way more

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:43.840
than people could eat.

00:01:43.840 --> 00:01:45.680
Is there anything a
more modest sprinkle

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:47.920
of celery seed a day
might help with?

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:49.920
"Treatment of women's
sexual dysfunction

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:51.280
using celery seed
(Apium graveolens):

00:01:51.280 --> 00:01:52.720
A double-blind, randomized,

00:01:52.720 --> 00:01:55.360
placebo-controlled
clinical trial."

00:01:55.360 --> 00:01:57.280
And this study used
a culinary-friendly dose

00:01:57.280 --> 00:02:00.240
of celery seed—
about 500 mg.

00:02:00.240 --> 00:02:04.720
That's about ¼ tsp per capsule,
three times per day.

00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:06.160
At the end of six weeks,

00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:07.440
there was
a significant improvement

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:09.360
in the self-reported
sexual functioning

00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:13.040
among those eating celery seeds,
with significant improvements

00:02:13.040 --> 00:02:16.720
across multiple measures
within just three weeks.

00:02:16.720 --> 00:02:18.720
What about celery juice?

00:02:18.720 --> 00:02:20.080
There was a case
report of a man

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:22.320
who juiced a bunch
of celery every day

00:02:22.320 --> 00:02:24.400
and had a drop
in blood pressure

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:26.960
and what appeared to be a
nonrandomized controlled trial

00:02:26.960 --> 00:02:30.880
in which an undisclosed amount
of celery juice seemed to help.

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:33.120
A review concluded
that celery can be considered

00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:35.440
an antihypertensive agent,

00:02:35.440 --> 00:02:38.080
but the quality of evidence
seems slight.

00:02:38.080 --> 00:02:39.760
What's the downside though?

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:42.240
Well, celery seed
is generally considered safe,

00:02:42.240 --> 00:02:44.000
and a safety evaluation
was performed

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:46.640
in the blood pressure trial
that indicated so,

00:02:46.640 --> 00:02:49.040
but maybe not for everybody.

00:02:49.040 --> 00:02:50.960
Here is a case report
of someone who had been taking

00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:54.240
about two tablespoons
of dried celery leaves a day,

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:57.520
and it seemed to cause overactive
thyroid gland activity;

00:02:57.520 --> 00:02:59.360
the same happened
to this woman,

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:03.120
who had been taking celery
extract powder for weight loss.

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:06.960
She did lose 57 pounds (26 kg)
in 78 days

00:03:06.960 --> 00:03:09.360
but that was likely because
the celery extract

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:11.360
led to hyperthyroidism.

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:13.200
That is not a healthy way
to lose weight,

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:17.680
risking side effects with names
like thyrotoxic paralysis.

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:20.400
Celery is also
an allergen for some,

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:23.440
often called
"pollen-related food allergy."

00:03:23.440 --> 00:03:25.440
People who are allergic
to some pollens

00:03:25.440 --> 00:03:28.240
are more likely to have
an allergy to celery,

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:29.920
such as what happened
in this rare case

00:03:29.920 --> 00:03:31.760
of severe anaphylactic shock

00:03:31.760 --> 00:03:35.040
after consumption
of raw celery.

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:37.280
Some only get allergic reactions
to celery

00:03:37.280 --> 00:03:40.160
if they eat it
before exercising.

00:03:40.160 --> 00:03:42.880
Heating celery eradicates
symptoms for about 50 percent

00:03:42.880 --> 00:03:46.320
of people with a celery allergy,
but those who react

00:03:46.320 --> 00:03:49.920
to raw celery also react
when it's dried.

00:03:49.920 --> 00:03:52.080
Even if you don't have
a celery allergy,

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:54.720
a warning for those
who eat a lot of celery,

00:03:54.720 --> 00:03:59.360
celery juice, or celeriac,
also known as celery root.

00:03:59.360 --> 00:04:01.360
There are compounds
called psoralens

00:04:01.360 --> 00:04:03.600
in the celery/parsnip/
parsley family

00:04:03.600 --> 00:04:06.240
that can make you
sensitive to sunlight.

00:04:06.240 --> 00:04:07.920
Farmworkers can suffer
from a condition

00:04:07.920 --> 00:04:09.440
known as celery blisters,

00:04:09.440 --> 00:04:13.520
when handling plants without
skin protection in the sun.

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:16.320
Even grocery store workers
who go from the produce aisle

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:19.120
to the tanning salon
can get into trouble.

00:04:19.120 --> 00:04:21.360
These compounds can make
their way into our skin

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:23.280
from the inside out as well,

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:26.000
and they are not
destroyed by cooking.

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:29.360
Too much time in the sun after
commencing a "celery soup diet"

00:04:29.360 --> 00:04:30.960
or spending time
on a tanning bed

00:04:30.960 --> 00:04:34.000
an hour after eating
just one large celery root

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:38.640
may be enough to result
in a serious blistering burn.

00:04:38.640 --> 00:04:39.520
Finally today,

00:04:39.520 --> 00:04:41.680
is it true there are foods like celery

00:04:41.680 --> 00:04:46.080
that take more calories to
digest than they provide?

00:04:46.080 --> 00:04:47.600
What are some
dietary strategies

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:51.200
for the prevention and
treatment of obesity?

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:53.520
Large portion sizes
are often targeted,

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:55.080
and so restriction
of portion size

00:04:55.080 --> 00:04:58.080
is an important element
of many diet programs,

00:04:58.080 --> 00:05:01.120
but it’s hard to get
people to eat less food.

00:05:01.120 --> 00:05:04.320
A more effective approach
may be to shift the emphasis

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:06.560
from the quantity
of food eaten

00:05:06.560 --> 00:05:09.120
to the quality of
the food eaten.

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:12.160
By choosing foods with
lower calorie density,

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:13.360
we can eat the same
amount of food,

00:05:13.360 --> 00:05:16.560
or even more food,
while losing weight.

00:05:16.560 --> 00:05:19.680
Are there foods with
negative calories,

00:05:19.680 --> 00:05:23.520
foods that take more energy to
digest than they provide?

00:05:23.520 --> 00:05:25.840
Does eating celery,
for example,

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:28.640
result in negative
energy balance?

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:31.040
Celery is a readily
available whole-food

00:05:31.040 --> 00:05:33.440
that has the ability to add
bulk and flavor to a meal,

00:05:33.440 --> 00:05:35.760
without adding
excess calories.

00:05:35.760 --> 00:05:39.200
It’s also subject to
a renowned health myth,

00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:41.040
that when consuming celery

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:42.960
there is a ‘negative’
intake of calories

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:45.920
and therefore the energy
required for its digestion,

00:05:45.920 --> 00:05:47.920
assimilation and nutrient
storage is assumed

00:05:47.920 --> 00:05:51.760
to be greater than the
energy it itself contains.

00:05:51.760 --> 00:05:54.240
So they put it
to the test.

00:05:54.240 --> 00:05:56.080
A cup of celery—
about two stalks—

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:58.640
has 16 calories.

00:05:58.640 --> 00:06:03.280
To digest that much celery
takes about 14 calories.

00:06:03.280 --> 00:06:05.760
So no, the consumption
of celery does not

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:07.440
induce a negative
energy balance,

00:06:07.440 --> 00:06:10.480
but you are only left
with two calories.

00:06:10.480 --> 00:06:14.400
This fact combined with the
high fiber and water content

00:06:14.400 --> 00:06:16.080
of celery, does make
it a good snack

00:06:16.080 --> 00:06:19.600
for inclusion in a diet for
weight loss or management.

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:25.280
Maybe negative calorie foods
is not a myth after all, though.

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:27.920
Researchers at Penn State offered
people a meal of pasta,

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:31.040
in which they could eat
as much as they wanted.

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:33.840
If in addition to the
all-you-can-eat pasta meal

00:06:33.840 --> 00:06:37.600
they gave people
a small salad,

00:06:37.600 --> 00:06:39.360
what do you
think happened?

00:06:39.360 --> 00:06:42.000
Did those 50 extra
calories of salad

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:44.960
just end up on top of
the pasta calories?

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:48.800
No, they ended up eating
less pasta over all,

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:52.000
and not just 50 calories
less pasta,

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:54.160
65 less calories,

00:06:54.160 --> 00:06:56.720
and by adding
a bigger salad,

00:06:56.720 --> 00:07:00.640
ended up eating a
100 fewer calories.

00:07:00.640 --> 00:07:05.440
So effectively, the salad
provided “negative calories.”

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:08.120
They ate a salad on top
of what else they were eating.

00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:11.840
They ate more food and ended
up with less calories in their system,

00:07:11.840 --> 00:07:14.000
because it bulked up their
stomachs so much.

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:16.720
Of course it depends
what kind of salad.

00:07:16.720 --> 00:07:20.000
They’re not talking about
your typical commercially

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:23.440
available salads with like
ranch dressing and cheese.

00:07:23.440 --> 00:07:25.040
You add those
kinds of salad

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:27.600
and you end up
eating less pasta,

00:07:27.600 --> 00:07:30.560
but there are so many calories
in conventional salads

00:07:30.560 --> 00:07:33.360
you end up worse off
calorie-wise in the end.

00:07:33.360 --> 00:07:36.640
But healthy
salads worked.

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:40.160
They conclude: “eat less” is
not always the best advice

00:07:40.160 --> 00:07:42.560
for foods very low
in energy density,

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:45.600
such as water-rich
vegetables—like salad.

00:07:45.600 --> 00:07:47.680
Larger portions
increase satiety,

00:07:47.680 --> 00:07:48.640
the feeling of
fullness,

00:07:48.640 --> 00:07:52.257
and reduce meal
calorie intake.

